#. 戦刃むくろの致命傷は、
#. <CLT 3>後頭部の打撃痕<CLT>だったはずだよ！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Mukuro died because of the <CLT 3>blow to the back of the\n"
"head<CLT> she suffered!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>全身の無数の傷<CLT>ってのは？
#. あれは、事件とは関係ねーのか？
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What about <CLT 3>the wounds all over the rest of her body<CLT>?\n"
"They didn't have anything to do with it?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマファイルによると、
#. あれは、以前からあった<CLT 3>古傷<CLT>らしいんだ…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The Monokuma File makes it clear that <CLT 3>those weren't\n"
"fresh wounds<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 古傷じゃ…関係ねーか…
msgctxt "0004 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, good point. If they were old, I guess they\n"
"don't really matter..."
msgstr ""

#. では、間違いないな。
#. あいつの致命傷は後頭部の殴打だったようだ…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Okay, then we're safe in assuming the blow to the back\n"
"of her head is what killed her."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、凶器って…？
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But then...what was the murder weapon?"
msgstr ""

#. モ、モノクマファイルには…
#. 鉄パイプ程度の太さの…棒状の物で殴られたって…
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"The M-Monokuma File says she was hit with a b-blunt\n"
"object, about as thick as a m-metal pipe..."
msgstr ""

#. …って事は、ツルハシだな！
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...Oh! I bet it was the pickaxe!"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして…そうなるのよ…！
#. ツルハシで殴ったら…殴打どころか頭蓋骨粉砕よ…！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"H-How is that even possible!? If you hit someone\n"
"w-with that, it'd cave their s-skull in completely!"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、ツルハシを逆に持って、
#. 持ち手の柄の部分で殴ったんだべ！
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well...maybe they held it the other way, and hit her\n"
"with the handle!"
msgstr ""

#. 無理よ…重さのバランスが悪いもの…
#. い、威力のある一撃なんて不可能だわ…
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"No w-way. The balance would be all off. Y-You wouldn't\n"
"be able to swing it with a-any kind of power..."
msgstr ""

#. なんなら…試してあげるわよ…？
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I w-wouldn't mind testing it on y-you if you want...!"
msgstr ""

#. さてはオメー…間違ったフリして、
#. 金属の方で殴るつもりだな…？
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"N-No thanks. I bet you'd just hit me with the metal\n"
"end and call it an accident..."
msgstr ""

#. その後…あんたの汚い脳ミソを取り出して…
#. 床に叩きつけて…ツバを吐きかけてやるのよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'd love to s-scoop out that nasty brain of yours,\n"
"throw it on the g-ground, and spit on it!"
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハッハ！　気が合うな！！
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hahahaha! I feel the same way! Looks like we're on the\n"
"same page this time!"
msgstr ""

#. 合ってるの、それ…？
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Seriously...?"
msgstr "Nghiêm túc sao...?"

#. 凶器なら、すでに見つかっているぞ…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We want to figure out what killed her, right? It just\n"
"so happens we already know."
msgstr ""

#. み、見つかったんですか！？
#. さすがは…白夜様…ッ！
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"W-We already know!? I knew we could count on you,\n"
"M-Master!"
msgstr ""

#. なんだべ？　本当の凶器って…？
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So what was it?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、答えてやれ。お前にもわかっているはずだ。
#. この事件の<CLT 3>本当の凶器<CLT>がな…
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Go ahead and tell them, Makoto. Surely you've deduced\n"
"the <CLT 3>real murder weapon<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ええっ！？
#. それは偽装工作って事になったじゃん…
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"What!? If that's true, they did one heck of a job\n"
"covering it up..."
msgstr ""

#. …お前はそんなにも処刑になりたいのか？
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Do you really want to die that much?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 呆れて物も言えないって事よッ！
#. わかってるの、苗木！？
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"He's so appalled, h-he can't even talk...! You can see\n"
"that, r-right Makoto!?"
msgstr ""

#. なんで、腐川っちはわかるんだべ？
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "How do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いつも…こういう態度を取られてるからよ…
#. だからもう…以心伝心なのよ…！
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"C-Cuz that's always how he treats *me*! It's like w-we\n"
"have a psychic link...!"
msgstr ""

#. それ、違うと思う…
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I...don't think that's it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. なんだ、思い出せないのか？
#. ほんの少し前の事だというのに…
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Have you already forgotten? It was just a short while\n"
"ago..."
msgstr ""

#. お前と調査を行った際に見つけたあれだ…
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Remember what we found during our investigation?"
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様と２人っきりで…調べ物…！
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You mean...wh-when it was just the two of you!?"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、嫉妬？
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "There's that jealousy again..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>この事件の…<CLT><CLT 3>本当の凶器<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. それは、おそらく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The <CLT><CLT 3>real murder weapon<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの後頭部を殴打した凶器は…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Mukuro was hit in the back of the head with something,\n"
"and that's what killed her."
msgstr ""

#. 武道場のロッカーで見つけた、
#. <CLT 3>ジュラルミン製の矢<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And that something was...the <CLT 3>titanium arrow<CLT> we found\n"
"in the locker in the dojo."
msgstr ""

#. ジュラルミン製の矢…？
#. 犯人は、それで戦刃むくろを殴ったんか？
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"An arrow... That's what the culprit attacked Mukuro\n"
"with?"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、間違いない…
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Indeed, there's no doubt about it."
msgstr ""

#. そう…なのかな…？
#. それって、おかしくない…？
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Are you sure? That sounds...kinda weird."
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと…あんた！
#. 白夜様に口答えなんて…１００万年早いわよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0042 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"H-Hey! How dare you back-talk Master!? You have n-no\n"
"right...!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、気になるんだから仕方ないじゃん！！
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I'm not back-talking anything! I'm just saying what I\n"
"think!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが疑うのも無理ないか…
#. だって、凶器には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't blame Hina for doubting it. Because there's\n"
"one more thing about that weapon...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう１つ、<CLT><CLT 3>隠された秘密<CLT><CLT 4>があるんだもんな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One more <CLT><CLT 3>secret<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
